      "name": "Force Blast",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>You unleash a bolt of physical power at a creature or object within range. Make a spell attack roll. The blast deals force damage equal to 1d6 + your spellcasting ability modifier.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You deal double damage.<br /><strong>Success</strong> You deal full damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6</p>"
